```

```json
{"prose_translation": "But supposing him to be in the company, they went a day's journey, and sought him among their relatives and acquaintances, and when they did not find him, they returned to Jerusalem seeking him."}
```

```json
{"prose_translation":"And it happened that after three days they found him in the temple, sitting in the midst of the teachers and listening to them and asking them questions;"}
```

```json
{"prose_translation": "And when they saw him, they were astonished, and his mother said to him, \"Child, why have you done this to us?\""}
```

```json
{"prose_translation": "Behold, your father and I have been anxiously seeking you."}
```

```json
{"prose_translation": "And he said to them, \"Why is it that you were looking for me?\""}
```

